BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9840455a-0a3a-3a0f-9e47-7cf3ec51bcd3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
